    title: "main_function entrypoint kind overloaded: 2/11 target a FILE node (Python if __name__=='__main__' with no main() func) vs 9/11 a function node, both conf 1.0, undocumented"  # d6f8
    status: todo_hard  # d6f8
    priority: 2  # d6f8
    parent:  # d6f8
